How this project uses and modifies Fish Audio Materials:

- Runtime dependency on fish-speech v2.0.0-beta (not copied into this tree).
- Training-time patches in src/fish_studio/training/ (especially
  lora_patch.py and reference_dataset.py): LoRA module targeting, tied
  embedding logits, embedding adapter scale, and a position gate that keeps
  adapters off the system/reference prefix.
- install.sh downloads the fishaudio/s2-pro checkpoint for local inference
  and fine-tuning.
